      "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2024/03/Pixelated-cover.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Welcome to Pixelated episode 122. This week, Abner, Damien, and Will discuss the first slate of iPhone Duo reviews, as Apple dives headfirst into a crowded foldable field for thee very first time. What should Android OEMs learn from the iPhone Duo, and what did Apple fail to catch up to the competition on? As always, there’s plenty to discuss.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Enjoy the show? You can listen to our weekly members-only Pixelated Pro bonus episode by <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/pro/\">signing up for 9to5Google Pro</a> for just $5 per month, or about $1 per episode.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Sponsored by Proton Unlimited</strong>: Pixelated listeners can save 30% on an annual subscription to the company’s suite of privacy-friendly services by <a href=\"https://proton.me/9to5google\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">signing up using our link</a>. Thanks to Proton Unlimited for sponsoring the podcast.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-audio\"><audio controls src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/10/pixelated-122-main-audio.mp3\"></audio></figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 id=\"h-subscribe\" class=\"wp-block-heading\">Subscribe</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLcKP282Ii48tKK_KUt1kq1Ist9FkYR6lO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">YouTube Podcasts</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://pca.st/podcast/ac8e6ce0-06b1-0136-c264-7d73a919276a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Pocket Casts</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/7pMiADiw0KAEW9Tg9UAEnZ?si=y8-L9zobTTucmjDVvMJOoQ&amp;dl_branch=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Spotify</a></li>\n\n\n\n<li>Amazon Music</li>\n\n\n