    {
      "id": 1792837059458,
      "title": "XREAL 1 Pro+ 智能眼镜国行上架：峰值亮度提升至 1200 尼特、鼻托结构重新设计，3499 元",
      "content": "<p data-vmark=\"2c99\">IT之家 10 月 24 日消息，XREAL 10 月 16 日在海外发布了新款 AR 眼镜 XREAL 1 Pro+，主要提升面板亮度，同时调整人体工程学设计，目前该机国行版本已在京东上架，<strong>定价 3499 元</strong>，10 月 27 日发售。</p><dir><a contenteditable=\"false\" href=\"https://u.jd.com/5Ojr8UQ\" target=\"_blank\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/51jQQaM\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5OjgYVQ\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5gjiH3I\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/5Djs12n\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5OjsDms\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5rjiSrO\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252f5Gj8OsK%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-itwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5gjOhfS\" data-lpwxurl=\"https://u.jd.com/5ajKl0m\"   data-ncid=\"257764\"><span class=\"card main-site\"><span class=\"card-logo\"><img src=\"https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/545399/38/7391/45904/6ad4e0b1F6a01a2b8/008332032087731e.png\" w=\"800\" h=\"800\"></span><span class=\"card-info\"><span class=\"card-title\"><span class=\"mall-data\">京东</span><span class=\"card-name\"> XREAL 1 Pro+ 智能眼镜</span></span><span class=\"card-abstract\"></span><span class=\"card-controls\"><span class=\"price\"> 3499 元</span><span class=\"card-btn-deep\">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-vmark=\"bb75\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/b5efe74e-2409-4703-8165-2ae2b261ad00.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"764\" h=\"1126\" data-weibo=\"0\" data-vmark=\"9a22\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-vmark=\"ff6f\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/9f4d1bf0-b13b-4ce9-8175-282bb28d3d18.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto\" w=\"586\" h=\"1354\" data-weibo=\"1\" data-vmark=\"c43e\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"376a\">XREAL 1 Pro+ 采用重新设计的鼻托结构，旨在改善眼镜与面部的贴合度，提升长时间观看时的舒适性。其搭载双 0.55 英寸索尼 Micro-OLED 面板，峰值亮度最高可达 1200 尼特，较前代产品的 700 尼特明显提升。</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-vmark=\"0930\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/c35c3078-9523-40c5-af87-f27f51e613a4.png\" w=\"1192\" h=\"678\" data-weibo=\"2\" data-vmark=\"3334\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"3895\">除了更高的峰值亮度，新品还加入 AI HDR 功能，借助 AI 技术改善画面对比度，让用户通过眼镜观看内容时获得更好的视觉体验。同时眼镜新增标准、电影和阅读三种显示模式，用户可以根据日常使用、观看影片或阅读等不同场景选择合适的显示效果。</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-vmark=\"6058\"><img src=\"https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/10/9e4231de-69af-4976-8c5e-9f7e4fcddc7b.png\" w=\"1186\" h=\"656\" data-weibo=\"3\" data-vmark=\"5801\" class=\"no-alt-img\"></p><p data-vmark=\"f702\">XREAL 表示，新款眼镜还改进了内置的 Real 3D 引擎，可将普通 2D 内容转换为具有空间感的 3D 画面，处理帧率最高提升至 60 FPS，</p><p data-vmark=\"544b\">新品的其他核心硬件变化不大，仍搭载 Xreal 自研的 X1 空间计算芯片，视场角也维持在 57 度，与上一代产品相同。</p><ul class=\" list-paddingleft-2\"><li><p data-vmark=\"8b04\"><span class=\"font-color-red\"><strong>京东 11.11 无门槛红包</strong> </span>面额至高 26888 元，每天抽 3 次：<a href=\"https://u.jd.com/FOYj5JY\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"点此抽红包\" data-androidurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FGYH495\" data-iosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FrYcJdU\" data-uwpurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FGB8NxI\" data-hosurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FOY4FL9\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://u.jd.com/FaY789g\" data-wxmpurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2Fpages%2Funion%2Fproxy%2Fproxy%3FspreadUrl%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fu.jd.com%252FFDYoToy%26EA_PTAG%3D17078.27.380\" data-wapurl=\"https://u.jd.com/FOSLr9p\" data-itwxurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fFOB3bPb%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\" data-lpwxurl=\"ithome://openmp?appid=wx91d27dbf599dff74&amp;path=%2fpages%2funion%2fproxy%2fproxy%3fspreadUrl%3dhttps%253a%252f%252fu.jd.com%252fFrBG3Jg%26EA_PTAG%3d17078.27.380\"><strong>点此抽红包</strong></a><strong>。</strong></p></li><li><p data-vmark=\"2828\"><span class=\"font-color-orangered\"><strong>淘宝 11.11 无门槛红包</strong></span> 面额至高 26888 元，每天抽 1 次：<a href=\"https://s.click.taobao.com/7NGMyki\" target=\"_blank\" data-androidurl=\"https://s.click.taobao.com/xSbAyki\" data-iosurl=\"https://s.click.taobao.com/1DnFyki\" data-hosurl=\"https://1111.tmall.com/union?wh_alimama=true&amp;disableNav=YES&amp;es=C8kHy5160DsN%2BoQUE6FNzF%2F2mEuY7%2F9ms2NBebDf%2Fzd5M%2F3lzZnXaCN3uML25JKlonv6QcvcARY%3D&amp;tkSid=1791957598996_201031816_0.0&amp;ali_trackid=2:mm_123078715_3350300056_116137250072:1791957598996_201031816_0&amp;union_lens=lensId:PUB@1791957594@212ca4b4_0fe7_1a138fef23a_2444@01@eyJmbG9vcklkIjozODg1Miiwiic3BtQiiI6Il9wb3J0YWxfdjJfcGFnZXNfYWN0aXZpdHlfcmVkZW52ZWxvcGVfaW5kZXhfaHRtIn0ie;recoveryid:201031816_0@1791957599017&amp;pageId=20150318020007201&amp;rootPageId=20150318020007201&amp;xMktId=GKgmB9jxHbCYrW8okY0IQ0igUX-avpazWUoteYVaZOzkyZFxUj&amp;bxsign=tbkIVRyjIvySd8dIzqiNfX7uuOcUyml0yhEFYnO_KeArJHIHw4a6OzZ9xxZI_SXx0KwlL3xQki3msFsO77RfG0Jj1o2K2-fXQTX_eZ5L4a6ccKASrxzzPlJmB9bOteirG4MLjRitnYd2Nm1QUxAJGQBTw3OwuV8yPjLFsQNVSgMesq9SC1-ZLQ4BuO8RbifY-C_\" data-hosnexturl=\"https://s.click.taobao.com/Xc5c4di\" data-wxmpurl=\"https://s.click.taobao.com/mvdN4di\" data-wapurl=\"https://s.click.taobao.com/SACQyki\"><strong>点此抽红包</strong></a>。</p></li></ul>",
